    cnw:editorialNote "This file demonstrates how different versions of the same work (for instance, with different instrumentations or text) may be described. This song has one version for voice and piano, one for piano, one for mixed choir, and one for women's choir. At the \"History\" editing tab, you will notice that performances may be entered either for the work in general (that is, regardless of version) or with the individual versions.Please note: The content of this file has been modified for demonstration purposes and does not represent accurate real-world data." ;
